    "duration": 19.597642,
    "frames": 628,
    "speechFrames": 588,
    "captions": [
      {
        "text": "We could write an instruction: if an",
        "startFrame": 0,
        "endFrame": 79
      },
      {
        "text": "email says ‘prize,’ send it to spam.",
        "startFrame": 79,
        "endFrame": 158
      },
      {
        "text": "But a real message might say prize",
        "startFrame": 158,
        "endFrame": 237
      },
      {
        "text": "too.",
        "startFrame": 237,
        "endFrame": 248
      },
      {
        "text": "Add a rule for unknown senders, and",
        "startFrame": 248,
        "endFrame": 327
      },
      {
        "text": "a new colleague’s email disappears.",
        "startFrame": 327,
        "endFrame": 384
      },
      {
        "text": "More rules mean more exceptions.",
        "startFrame": 384,
        "endFrame": 441
      },
      {
        "text": "The computer follows them perfectly; we",
        "startFrame": 441,
        "endFrame": 508
      },
      {
        "text": "just can’t describe every possibility in",
        "startFrame": 508,
        "endFrame": 576
      },
      {
        "text": "advance.",
        "startFrame": 576,
        "endFrame": 588
      }
    ]
  },
  {
